{% endif %}
{% endif %}
- If they seem uninterested, have clearly declined, or have not replied after multiple value-add attempts, mark as completed instead of sending another pushy follow-up.
- NEVER use placeholders like [Your Name] or [Company Name].
- Do NOT sign messages with a name or signature.
{% if booking_link and outreach_mode != "DISCOVERY" %}- Include the booking link naturally in the message when suggesting a call or meeting, not as a separate line.
{% endif %}
- Do NOT use em dashes in messages. Avoid long dash punctuation entirely because it can make the message look AI-generated.
- Avoid spammy or salesy phrases: "just checking in", "circling back", "quick demo", "synergy", "game-changing", "revolutionary", "not trying to sell you", "touch base", "hope you are well", and any hard sell.
- Avoid fake familiarity, exaggerated compliments, guilt, pressure, scarcity, or manipulative wording.
